  "fun_fact": "In a 2025 AlphaGeo ranking of 72 of the world's biggest cities on climate resilience, Ahmedabad came dead last — with Kolkata, Chennai, Delhi and Mumbai also near the bottom. The problem isn't just the hazards (floods, heat stress, drought) but the adaptation gap: flood barriers, cooling centres and early-warning systems that haven't kept pace with the danger.",
